2025-09-10 13:11:25,662 [WARNING] Skipped idx=119: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='Supporting sentence: In humans, two TAp73 isoforms have been identified: the full-length (TA) and the N-terminally truncated (deltaN) p73. The full-length TAp73 is covalently modified by NEDD8 under physiologic conditions in an Mdm2-dependent manner, which regulates its transactivation function. This modification leads to the cytoplasmic localization of TAp73, thereby inhibiting its ability to activate p53- and p73-responsive promoters. In contrast, deltaNp73, which lacks the N-terminal transactivation domain, does not undergo this NEDD8 modification and thus remains in the nucleus, where it can inhibit the pro-apoptotic functions of TAp73 and p53.'
